@startuml
' Native PlantUML source converted from userflow-subscriptions.json
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam dpi 144
title RentBuild | Rental Operator — Select / Change Plan
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FB
  BorderColor #334155
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3BF
  DiamondBorderColor #64748B
}
start
:1. Plans\nUS15: current status and reference plans;
-> Select available plan;
:2. Confirmation\nUS16 / US17: selected plan + demo notice;
-> Confirm once;
if (3. Valid selection?\nActive plan exists? Same valid plan is\nrejected. Expired period may begin a new demo\nmonth.) then (Valid)
  :4. Demo saved\nPOST new record or PUT current record. Keep\nvalid period; refresh expired period.;
else (Unavailable / failed)
  :Alternative / retry\nLoad or save error: show translated reason,\npreserve selection, and retry after reload.;
endif
stop
caption SUPPLEMENT: PR12 FRONTEND DEMO; NO PAYMENT OR AUTOMATIC BILLING. FORMAL MOCKUP EXPORT\nPENDING.
@enduml
